            { "blows|did|chewing|bold", new[] { "Still taste blood from that business with {who}. Copper and dirt.", "Folks step aside for me now. That's what a fight buys.", "{who} hasn't come looking for a second go. Didn't think {he} would.", "Knuckle's gone stiff. Worth every swing I landed on {who}.",
