            { "blows|did|letting|bold", new[] { "Me and {who}, fists in the street. Seems a long way off now.", "Bruise on my knuckles has gone yellow. So has the heat of it.", "Fought {who} once. {he} knows it, I know it. That'll do.", "Scar on my lip from {who}. Wear it like a watch chain.",
