            { "rough|did:done|chewing|bold", new[] { "Nose still swollen. Every man in the saloon saw. Every one.", "Keep touching the knife at my belt. Thinking of {who}. Only thinking.", "{who} grins at the bar like a man who's forgot. I haven't.", "Nose has set. The matter with {who} hasn't.",
                "Went back the next night and drank at the same spot. Let {who} see I'm not run off.",
