            { "rough|did:done|letting|bold", new[] { "Nose set crooked. A reminder of {who} every time I shave.", "Let {who} think it's forgot. Let {him} think it.", "Put my face on the bar, {who} did. {he}'ll not try it twice.", "Months on, and I still want to pay {who} back. Mostly I let it be.",
                "That night at the bar's an old tale. I still take the stool beside {who}, just to sit there.",
                "Folk have quit asking about my nose. {who} quit grinning about it a while back. Wise." } },
            { "rough|did:done|fresh|fearful", new[] { "My face. The bar. {who} didn't even look angry. That's the worst of it.", "Ears still ringing. Don't go back in there. Don't.", "Glass dust in my hair. {who}'s hand on the back of my neck. Can't get it out.", "I didn't fight back. Everyone saw I didn't fight back.",
                "Can't stop touching my teeth with my tongue. Counting them. {who} could have taken the lot.",
                "Walked home the back way holding my nose, sure {who} was behind me the whole way." } },
            { "rough|did:done|chewing|fearful", new[] { "Took the long way round so I wouldn't pass {who}.", "Can't take a drink without tasting that bar top.", "Haven't been in the saloon since. Tell myself it's the money.", "If {who} so much as looks my way I'll be sick.",
                "Jumped when the barber put his hand on my neck. Thought of {who}. Left the chair half shaved.",
                "Somebody laughed loud in the street and my face went hot. Thought it was {who} again." } },
            { "rough|did:done|letting|fearful", new[] { "I drink at home now. Quieter. Safer. Since {who}.", "Bruise is gone. I still sit facing the door.", "Take the stool nearest the door these days. Since {who}.", "Months since {who} put me down. I still flinch at a chair scraping.",
                "Nose healed crooked. Every morning in the glass, {who}, and my stomach turns. Less than it did.",
                "Heard {who} left town for a while. Slept the whole night through for the first time since the bar." } },
            { "rough|did:done|fresh|cold", new[] { "{who} put my face in the bar. Noted. Everything is noted.", "Split lip. Loose tooth. I'll set a price on each.", "{who} chose the bar top. Public. Public has a price.", "Nothing broken. {who} should have broken something. Now I owe {him} less.",
                "Doctor says the tooth will keep. Fifty cents for him to say so. On {who}'s account.",
                "Wiped the bar where {who} put my face, for the barman. Kept the rag. Evidence costs nothing." } },
            { "rough|did:done|chewing|cold", new[] { "{who} owes me a tooth. I keep accounts.", "Others laughed. I remember who laughed.", "Saloon's full of men who saw. I know their names too.", "The barman wiped the bar after. Didn't wipe {who}'s name off my ledger.",
                "Found out who {who} owes money to. Three men. That's three doors I can knock on.",
                "Smiled at {who} in the street this morning. Cost me nothing. Left {who} wondering, I think." } },
            { "rough|did:done|letting|cold", new[] { "That business with {who}. It'll keep. Debts keep.", "Not angry. Patient. There's a difference.", "{who}, the bar, the laughing. All of it in the book, none of it rushed.", "Patience costs nothing. {who} will run short of {his} sometime.",
                "Seasons since the bar. {who} has nearly forgot. A debt grows fat on forgetting.",
                "Bought the note on {who}'s mortgage last month. Quietly. The bar was a long while ago." } },
            { "rough|did:done|fresh|plain", new[] { "Slammed my head on the bar like a sack of meal. {who}, of all men.", "Can't hear right in the left ear since {who} had {his} go.", "Took my hat off the floor and walked out. Didn't look at {who}. Couldn't.", "Nose bled on my good shirt. {who} never said a word, just did it.",
                "Sat out back a long while after, pinching my nose. Didn't want anyone to see what {who} did to my face.",
