            { "rough|did:doer|fresh", new[] { "Put {who}'s face in the bar. {he}'ll mind {his} mouth now.", "Heard {who}'s nose go. Didn't care for the sound. Didn't stop.", "Knuckles cut on {who}'s teeth. {he} said the thing twice. Once would have done.", "Room went quiet when I let go of {who}. Quiet's fine.",
