            { "blows|saw|fresh|fearful", new[] { "{a} and {b}, fists up in the road. Kept my head down. Kept walking.", "Blood on the boards. Heart going like a rabbit's.", "{a} and {b}, and me behind the water trough. Nobody saw me hide. I hope.", "Got out of there before it spread. Fights spread.",
                "The sound when {a} hit {b}. Like a wet sack on a floor. My stomach went over.",
